{"id":"5991","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5991_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-velum_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图中，水平范围巨大的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">缟状</span>附属云云附着于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状鬃积雨云</span>的上部。在缟状云形成后，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云顶部</span>渗透并刺穿了缟状云。高空风正在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">顺风剪切缟状云</span>。</p>\n<p>照片前景中是被强低空风剪切的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎</span>积云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡</span>积云单体。从积雨云一些部分扩散形成的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷层云</span>充斥着天空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Petr Hykš","location":"捷克，696 33 Archlebov","latitude":"纬度: 49° 2' 37'' N","longitude":"经度: 17° 0' 17'' E","date":"19 June 2016 1454 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东东北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.13","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.13"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5991_syn_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-velum_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>随着低压槽从南西南方向靠近，天气不稳定，同时积雨云发展。在几小时后，向北看到了雷暴。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5991_upper_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-velum_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在北东北50公里的探测 – 从地面至726 hPa的不稳定层</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5991_sat_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-velum_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>积雨云在槽线上发展并向北移动</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2015","location":"","lat